lay piped in 60s songs by The Beach Boys and more modern schtick. They sell a few cig brands at $8 a pack and they have a cigarette machine and Wurlitzer. Five kinds of tacos, mostly spicy, 2 for $7 or 3 for $9. Beers start at $2 and max out at $6, wine by the glass, shots and mixed drinks. C'mon down. Outdoor patio for smokers and night owl conversationalist. Spooky, retro living tool to chill out."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HXJ1qmzRNu-fy3qKGyHc7w","photo_id":"Uhv-Ix-7Dh9Yw2k6qwebRQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Uhv-Ix-7Dh9Yw2k6qwebRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8763644099235535},{"business_id":"HXJ1qmzRNu-fy3qKGyHc7w","photo_id":"cC6xHuw3XpxxtvmtloutNg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/cC6xHuw3XpxxtvmtloutNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8468033075332642},{"business_id":"HXJ1qmzRNu-fy3qKGyHc7w","photo_id":"IHH6IytiS56CSfKI0Kbq2A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IHH6IytiS56CSfKI0Kbq2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7901773452758789},{"business_id":"HXJ1qmzRNu-fy3qKGyHc7w","photo_id":"j9tALsYUa-2MpEGIIhayxQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/j9tALsYUa-2MpEGIIhayxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7716066837310791}]},"notebook_case":null}
